@* The same crossed-star mark RatingBadge already uses for an unrated library,
   reused here for an unrated scenario: one visual language for "would place,
   but is outside the rating" instead of two. Rendered only when there is a
   reason to show — a scenario with no stated reason is rated by definition,
   see MatrixMetadata.ReadFeatures. *@
<span class="not-rated-badge" title="@Reason" aria-label="@Reason" role="img">
    <RatingIcon Place="unrated"/>
</span>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public required string Reason { get; set; }
}
